ve if they have  listened while she's here tun Berg will  attend to global climate strikes on  those UN meetings as for how she plans  to return home Adriana that is unclear  at this point very good question I love  this little girl she's so unapologetic  and poised I saw her speakin in  Stockholm and she had the whole room  mesmerized before she even opened her  mouth she's amazing yeah and so  committed at such a young age just 16  years old it's incredible Meg thank you
 

